From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:06:00 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 129/230] Use single-letter Persian day abbreviations on date
 strip
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Revert the 3-letter Persian day forms back to single letters (د س چ پ ج ش ی)
which are the standard Persian calendar abbreviations and fit the chip design
without overflowing at 390px. English day labels unchanged.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
